    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">A pirate princess and a cursed assassin find their fates intertwined. Ananna of the Tanarau abandons ship when her parents try to marry her off to an ally pirate clan. She wants to captain her own boat, not serve as second-in-command to a handsome and clueless man. But her escape has dire consequences when she learns that her fianc&amp;#xE9;&apos;s clan has sent an assassin after her. And when this assassin, Naji, finally finds her, things get even worse. Ananna inadvertently triggers a nasty curse--with a life-altering result. Now, Ananna and Naji are forced to become uneasy allies as they work to complete three impossible tasks that will cure the curse.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
